            <div xml:id="m-9c31133f-4495-4feb-82a9-7668704f72d2">
              <lg xml:id="m-c906632d-a179-4f09-9181-5388c5f65041">
                <l xml:id="m-68940f64-0415-4e0b-a4ec-5a587de49077" facs="#m-5db3d469-e102-4fe8-8cc3-f4d97f43fd8c" label="text-like">Common of a Virgin not a Martyr. Mass I. 1225</l><l xml:id="m-60d70c56-2348-4830-a49e-ea030ec80345" facs="#m-4c44d98a-f33e-46d9-8342-ca62ad17e361" label="text-like">MASS OF TWO OR MORE VIRGIN MARTYRS.</l><l xml:id="m-0c865a84-5863-4f9a-8c96-a13179b4c462" facs="#m-80eb3d0c-ee6b-459c-8d4c-a32a3e04a240" label="text-like">All as for one Virgin Martyr, except the follouing:</l><l xml:id="m-f1f66e63-aeea-4ef4-addb-a900c97f918e" facs="#m-d803a2d2-27b5-488c-ad57-c724f9135855" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-3533d7d8-70a3-4096-94fa-dc1822524907" facs="#m-48d19ebe-3382-4816-bf01-48581b32fb57" label="lyrics-like">A nobis, quaésumus Dómine rári: t ut quas digna mente non</l><l xml:id="m-39ba576b-b97b-48cb-ba3b-2f679da89214" facs="#m-d5297110-6737-48ab-87c0-7db2a414e288" label="lyrics-like">U Deus noster, sanctárum Virgi¬</l><l xml:id="m-5024a3d5-1837-4205-a9d9-01d1395ea0a0" facs="#m-8cb2a1d1-926c-47fa-b142-b7afc4453ba2" label="lyrics-like">póssumus celebrâre,“ humilibus</l><l xml:id="m-df5c5ab6-a323-4f7b-b23d-ac5313ac2bad" facs="#m-70c344be-3cec-4c72-8663-3ff73ce9202c" label="lyrics-like">num et Mártyrum tuárum N. et N.] saltem frequentémus obséquiis. Per</l><l xml:id="m-52a81af9-42c1-49e3-ae8f-1ce6eb796a4d" facs="#m-665425a3-b3f4-4127-b735-64caa435836e" label="lyrics-like">palmas incessábili devotióne vene-l Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4083cd7c-56b9-4f0c-8f59-56586ef804d2" facs="#m-6d66e7e4-1f4d-4ce3-b3d2-675c635e3044" label="lyrics-like">Epistle. De virgínibus. from the Mass Vúltum túum. p. 1230.</l><l xml:id="m-8a75570a-d53e-4191-bf9f-880283f6e1d8" facs="#m-70b60ce0-e55e-476f-9882-af7abc7559ad" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-ea6d080c-2262-4fe5-a419-f4dafb1d4992" facs="#m-37d6b4a7-ddc9-4ee7-99dc-8fcf1d8dcb4e" label="lyrics-like">(Nténde, quaésumus Dómine, mú-sicut per haec beáta mystéria illis</l><l xml:id="m-025a48bc-aafe-45fa-8315-9203b83e622b" facs="#m-aa587a8f-d5bb-4d17-a609-328961d87231" label="lyrics-like">A nera altáribus tuis pro sanctá¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fe39aa1-9d83-4cea-98cd-d494aac96bdc" facs="#m-4fe3ece3-5e1b-441e-a843-c7182ccbde99" label="lyrics-like">glóriam contulisti, ita nobis indul¬</l><l xml:id="m-b23daba8-c0ca-4370-82af-d7140cf1f522" facs="#m-f7f25650-cb31-4b8c-bf03-50c4301ab0ba" label="lyrics-like">rum Virginum et Mártyrum tuárum</l><l xml:id="m-49cb9367-1365-44b8-a32b-efcb12b77a32" facs="#m-5c21ce8d-689e-4b1b-9bca-563c0a1bc7f4" label="lyrics-like">géntiam largiáris. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-e145eb33-d874-40c9-a9b8-65dd5acd3572" facs="#m-e3b22543-fdbf-49fb-86b0-2ba6812e8189" label="lyrics-like">N. et N. festivitáte propósita: ut,</l><l xml:id="m-e13a2eaf-0a61-41eb-8641-2051157612fd" facs="#m-7efeaaae-29d4-4237-b7da-02fd3d0a08d4" label="ambiguous">Postcommunion.</l><l xml:id="m-ce70828a-f7c7-4930-a870-6224ebb2e6e3" facs="#m-8c854f24-86bd-4b58-bbc0-63a5973db521" label="lyrics-like">Raesta nobis, quaésumus Dó-IN. :ut, quod ore contíngimus, pura</l><l xml:id="m-e5236742-6c5d-42ae-8131-70cdede6dfc8" facs="#m-4cb3fd09-e498-4e61-bad3-1921df93b5bd" label="lyrics-like">Lmine, intercedéntibus sanctis</l><l xml:id="m-2efcac20-607b-4c92-abf8-e1a144e54aad" facs="#m-06fdc0f2-c7f6-41dc-b68e-61d73449cc34" label="lyrics-like">mente capiámus. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-3e6bb677-b8a8-4b96-a66c-03327a2c8b75" facs="#m-b74f5f2f-43ff-4690-bca2-f639888f08bf" label="ambiguous">Virginibus et Martyribus tuis N. et</l><l xml:id="m-6bc11dad-00a5-4de8-a360-a9466ce0dd03" facs="#m-365df017-9221-4d1d-82e0-a3446bba33f2" label="text-like">I. MASS OF A VIRGIN NOT A MARTYR.</l><l xml:id="m-86e73215-946d-4651-96fa-3d6eddcdec17" facs="#m-df8c3395-b084-458e-b35d-2cfd52021808" label="ambiguous">Intr.</l><l xml:id="m-5f52dd3b-b1a1-46c4-a9f0-11c73a3f4e77" facs="#m-2daed30c-a5f8-44fa-80dc-fae69e3e48dd" label="ambiguous">8.</l><l xml:id="m-6b0627a9-f177-4c1d-810f-1ae2bd5d6a2e" facs="#m-68aad8eb-678d-404c-b781-8ea003bd8869" label="ambiguous">DIlexi-sti" justi-ti-am, et odi-sti iniqui¬</l><l xml:id="m-2c17ddcd-94e0-44fe-adfb-b31cd0a0e4bb" facs="#m-6a559055-8d36-41f0-b5dc-2f95511fdcef" label="lyrics-like">ún-xit te Dé- us, Dé- us</l><l xml:id="m-3bb59b6b-107f-4384-957f-e7bda3d184aa" facs="#m-d8900d9d-41dd-4356-841d-3b9f3c0bb201" label="lyrics-like">tá- tem : proptér-e-a</l><l xml:id="m-af0d1045-85b8-4787-aab8-85da4d6dd9f2" facs="#m-faa8fa43-8776-41c1-9894-3530ba885a2c" label="lyrics-like">prae consór-ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-ce686d13-e13f-4f9e-8df2-b36e57f4918a" facs="#m-6e6bcfb6-be30-4f89-b734-e2f832be14bb" label="lyrics-like">tú¬ us, 6le-o laetí¬ ti-ae</l><l xml:id="m-5d6b9009-dd29-401f-b7bd-de47c39102d7" facs="#m-53d407f2-ea20-4627-a49d-7957c42ed55e" label="lyrics-like">bus tú- is. T. P. Alle-lú-ia, al-le- lú- ia. Ps. Eru¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f0bb42e-7d7d-4bcf-b693-803f7c0f8ceb" facs="#m-ebf46733-3980-43ee-9004-77f8739b8367" label="lyrics-like">ctávit cor mé-um vérbum bónum:“dí-co égo ópera</l><l xml:id="m-8aa4deb8-de58-4b53-917e-4ffe6618eeb2" facs="#m-1427bcde-675b-4ab7-b06f-ea899b52dd59" label="lyrics-like">Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-8e59227d-6033-48ad-befd-5ee94c13888a" facs="#m-c5a4e328-1821-43a8-851e-b42dd78007da" label="lyrics-like">mé-a régi.</l><l xml:id="m-3a567bd7-d873-4fad-bd01-6354dac307fa" facs="#m-ff908cdf-48be-4979-8b75-62502add202f" label="ambiguous">Eu ou a e.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
